The MIT licence above covers the LLMFM source code only.

The music in `playlists/bundled/` is third-party content, redistributed under the
licence each publisher states for it, and is NOT covered by the MIT licence above.
Every bundled file has its own provenance record — source URL, stated licence, and
the sha256 the licence was verified against — in `playlists/bundled/tracks.json`,
with credits in `playlists/bundled/ATTRIBUTION.md`.

No synthesizer sample data is included or redistributed. LLMFM sends MIDI messages
to the synthesizer already installed on your machine; `gm.dls` is never read, copied,
extracted, or shipped.
